<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p>This blog explores AI safety and alignment — the problem of making AI systems do what we intend, not just what we say.</p>

      <p>I'm a builder and researcher with 10+ years in AI, four years in the modern generative AI era, and a growing conviction that alignment is the most important unsolved technical problem we face.</p>

      <p>I write about alignment research, frontier AI safety techniques, real-world deployment failures, and what it all means for people building AI systems today.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
